WEBVTT

01:00:29.737 --> 01:00:34.658
And many other countries,
who can't really do either,

01:00:34.682 --> 01:00:37.919
have to think about a couple of things.

01:00:37.943 --> 01:00:41.972
One is how to bootstrap
its technology workforce,

01:00:41.996 --> 01:00:47.360
because ultimately, those are the ones
that will drive the economy forward.

01:00:47.384 --> 01:00:53.783
Second is, what are some tech businesses
that require a local presence.

01:00:53.807 --> 01:00:59.022
For example, a Uber or Meituan
kind of company

01:00:59.046 --> 01:01:04.585
might be hard to do from US to Africa
or China to Africa,